				"mustUse": true,
				"summary": "Returns the path to the system's Roblox Studio executable.",
				"detail": "There is no guarantee that this will exist, but if Studio is installed this\nis where it will be.\n\n### Example usage\n\n```lua\nlocal roblox = require(\"@lune/roblox\")\n\nlocal pathToStudio = roblox.studioApplicationPath()\nprint(\"Studio is located at:\", pathToStudio)\n```"
